# The enters trigger creates the shared New Planet token tapped (CR 111.1, 111.4, 603.6a); the fixture has one of each color source for casting.
[Bot1 Deck]
David and Carol Marcus, Creators
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
